</text><rect x="1895" y="1050" width="430" height="78" rx="14" fill="#effcf4" stroke="#27ae60" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1930" y="1098" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Recebido pela Tesouraria</text><rect x="1895" y="1155" width="430" height="78" rx="14" fill="#eff6ff" stroke="#4b7bec" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1930" y="1203" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="21" font-weight="700" fill="#0b1f4d" text-anchor="start">Encerrar operação</text><rect x="70" y="1360" width="1085" height="55" rx="12" fill="#fff0f2" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="100" y="1396" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#d90429" text-anchor="start">▥  Reflexos no sistema: Auditoria, Relatórios e DRE Gerencial</text><rect x="1245" y="1360" width="1085" height="55" rx="12" fill="#eef8ff" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1275" y="1396" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#075f9c" text-anchor="start">▥  Reflexos no sistema: Auditoria, Relatórios, Classificação e DRE Gerencial</text><rect x="40" y="1505" width="2320" height="55" rx="12" fill="#eef3f8" stroke="none" stroke-width="2"/><text x="1200.0" y="1540" font-family="Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif" font-size="18" font-weight="600" fill="#233b5d" text-anchor="middle">Os documentos devem permanecer anexados no sistema, evitando o envio e a circulação de documentos em papel.</text></svg>